@baseUrl = http://localhost:5150

### 0. Authenticate as Admin (returns JWT Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "abeer@gmail.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 1. Get all cards
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Cards
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Level 1 cards (6 pairs) - Route Constraint :int:range(1,2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Cards/level/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Level 2 cards (10 pairs) - Route Constraint :int:range(1,2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Cards/level/2
Accept: application/json

### 4. Search Cards by keyword ([FromQuery] binding)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Cards/search?keyword=الفضاء
Accept: application/json

### 5. Add a new Card (POST - [FromBody])
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Cards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "كأس البطولة",
  "icon": "🏆",
  "category": "رياضة",
  "accentColor": "#14b8a6",
  "levelDifficulty": 1,
  "points": 150,
  "isActive": true
}

### 6. Update Card Title Only (Specialized PUT - [FromRoute] + [FromBody] DTO)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Cards/1/update-title
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "صاروخ الفضاء السريع"
}

### 7. Get all Players (with 1:1 Profile, 1:N GameSessions, N:M Achievements)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Players
Accept: application/json

### 8. Search Players by alphabetical keyword - Route Constraint :alpha
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Players/search/asia
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Paged GameSessions ([FromQuery] parameters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/GameSessions/paged?pageIndex=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 10. Record a new GameSession (POST - [FromBody])
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/GameSessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": 1,
  "level": 1,
  "pairsCount": 6,
  "attempts": 8,
  "timeElapsedSeconds": 24,
  "score": 1150,
  "isCompleted": true
}

